<h2 id="reply" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Chat reply shape</h2>

Mandatory **HTML table** (mrkd): Step run name · Scope slice · `step_run_id` · `chain_id` · Paras · Browser test · Log · Result.

- **0-preview** metrics in `(parens)`; omit **Total** for preview-only runs.
- **Total** = steps 1–6 only when applicable.
- On failure, include **`STEP_RUN_FAIL_PHASE`** and whether **`[PWLAD_RECOVER_HINT]`** was printed.

